# Build-context allowlist for the signer image (DPES-899).
# The reusable build workflow sends the repository root as context. Exclude everything first, then
# re-include only what cloud/Dockerfile.signer copies. Later rules win, so the bytecode and env
# exclusions come after the allow rules.
**
!cloud/src/mao_cloud/**
!cloud/requirements/controller.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
